<title>Venezuela and the Caribbean: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/venezuela/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-venezuela-2026-10-16T09:59:47.990Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:59:47 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Nicolás Maduro and his wife have again pleaded not guilty to U.S. conspiracy to torture charges in New York, while the United States has lifted sanctions on Jorge Rodríguez, head of Venezuela's National Assembly. The U.S. Space Force has deployed electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela, mirroring actions taken in Iran. EnergyNow reports that global shipping disruptions and Venezuelan supply pressure have widened the Alberta heavy oil discount to over $25 per barrel. In Chile, a Venezuelan gang member received a 20-year sentence for kidnapping and killing a dissident. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBOWEtSaTdPcDBycHFleVItZWtRTXBWSWs3bFVqZjZTZENLZFVTV0pSendaMlYzX2tGdzEtXzhvMDVTZHFUQmZZdGMxekRXdjZtcVhaVDJMeHEtZW95cFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOQVZ3VzZsQTJMSnlVV1QwemJZSjRBY0JrWTdBbGg4VmhMbG8tZzRDOHhRU01NOWJCV25Iem05S1BqanZjbDdray1rNUFYOTBKZS0xT2R5UTVUeHE3N0FvVmppUU5Dem5SUXZQb3hYYXhNekdPRjVMVEdEMFpMUGk1MjZJZGZtNlUwSzgtN25FM0ZtRG9NVzJUWGtWU0djQTBiYkY1Q20xSzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQVXFnM3A0T3lJeVdPVnZrVlZHT3l6dlBUbjZkZGdmYTd4NTFkZEE1TkpOVkNxaXpoZVBiQUNSNWhrRGl4cXZxS2VWeHN5aVVfbEpSR2doM0xwR1JiZHA5VjdkLVhrVHhBMTlNQmQ1ZGNOSGd1bDhFOEFFQlpveFRpcG43MUZ1OEwwWGxqeXFrLUNwakUxOTU5R19rZEFTQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1qbWp2TFdDU0Y1aVUyWWNhMmc3LWRMaWZYRkZSZ3V0WmpranllYVNLNzY2RUF2Nzk2QXQ0NE4wWG1vQ1RmQW9yYm91VVR5eWd3VTVQN0FHZDRZNHE5N